{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resurrection Core is a fast paced, vertically scrolling shooter game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy enemies and fearsome bosses, collect power-ups and resurrect enemy cores to increase your fire power. Game honors the classics of the arcade genre, but also adds unique, modern touch to gameplay mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Resurrect the cores </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> When enemies die, they sometimes leave behind their energy core. These cores can be resurrected to increase your fire power. Eventually they can be fused to become a powerful bomb that annihilates everything on the screen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master the weapon systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to strategically swap between light and heavy weapons. Light weapons shoot faster bullets and cover larger area of destruction. Some enemy types can only be destroyed with heavy weapons.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582670?t=1741699285","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582670/fe5300e60b2431f8b7fca9c39f07ec807ac5fc09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741699285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582670/a484b5d9a7300d108f7ad96f06539fb4388d6a53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741699285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582670/a484b5d9a7300d108f7ad96f06539fb4388d6a53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741699285","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resurrection Core is a fast paced, vertically scrolling shooter game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy enemies and fearsome bosses, collect power-ups and resurrect enemy cores 